{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Will a man rob</b> — This refers to tithe and terumah. For you say: How can one give a generous eye from this little? And this is not good, that you defraud me on account of the illumination and the lack that you elevate and lack — for if you do thus."], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The comment is textually difficult; the final clause 'for if you do thus' trails off without resolution, and the phrase 'the illumination and the lack that you elevate and lack' (המאירה והחסרון אשר אתם נארים וחסרים) is obscure, possibly corrupt; rendered hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:21.463446809Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}